{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "ראה ראיתי", :translit "re'eh re'iti", :gloss "seeing I have seen"} {:he "כ' בה'", :translit "kaf beit heh", :gloss "twenty [permutation] in [the letter] heh"} {:he "בפרך", :translit "b'farekh", :gloss "with rigor"} {:he "מרר", :translit "merer", :gloss "bitterness"} {:he "לחץ", :translit "lachatz", :gloss "oppression"} {:he "עינוי", :translit "inui", :gloss "affliction"} {:he "עבודה קשה", :translit "avodah kashah", :gloss "hard labor"} {:he "סנה", :translit "s'neh", :gloss "thornbush"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 5, :occurrences ["סנה"]} {:kind :other, :note "The doubled heh in ראה ראיתי corresponds to the five servitudes and the five occurrences of סנה."}], :frame {:text "The Sages identify five terms of servitude that characterize the Egyptian bondage. These are derived from verses describing Israel's labor: בפרך (Leviticus 25:43), מרר (Exodus 1:14), לחץ (Exodus 3:9), עינוי (Exodus 1:12), and עבודה קשה (Exodus 1:14). The doubled language of ראה ראיתי echoes the doubled expression of servitude in Exodus 1:13–14, ויעבידו מצרים את בני ישראל בפרך וימררו את חייהם.", :sources ["Exodus 1:13–14" "Leviticus 25:43" "Exodus 3:9"]}} {:quotes [{:he "צעקתם", :translit "tza'akatam", :gloss "their cry"} {:he "ואת צעקתם שמעתי", :translit "v'et tza'akatam shama'ti", :gloss "and their cry I have heard"} {:he "צעקתם", :translit "tza'akatam", :gloss "their cry"} {:he "צעקת סדום", :translit "tza'akat s'dom", :gloss "cry of Sodom"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 2, :occurrences ["צעקתם"]}], :frame {:text "The cry of Sodom is described as great: כי גדולה צעקת סדם וחטאתם כבדה מאד (Genesis 18:20). The Midrash compares the greatness of Israel's cry in Egypt to the cry of Sodom, reading the emphasis on צעקתם as indicating that their outcry reached a magnitude like that of Sodom.", :sources ["Genesis 18:20"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :masorah, :count 5, :occurrences ["סנה"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "סנה", :refs ["Deuteronomy 33:16" "Joshua 15:49" "1 Samuel 14:4"], :n 3, :lens :exact}]} {:kind :other, :note "The doubled heh in ראה ראיתי corresponds to the five servitudes and the five occurrences of סנה.", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :masorah, :count 2, :occurrences ["צעקתם"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "צעקתם", :refs ["Genesis 19:13" "Exodus 3:7"], :n 2, :lens :exact}]}], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:13:20.727426385Z", :model "glm-5.2"}